     "body": "<p>Yes, LDP 1.0 is considered done so there is less communication forums for it. I would note that this a W3 Community Group that formed around the idea of the Next LDP standard. <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/community/ldpnext/\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.w3.org/community/ldpnext/</a></p>\n\n<p>But it also, seemed to have fizzled out without much to show for it.</p>",
