  "description": "<p>Fedora4 allowed DirectContainers to include both <tt>ldp:hasMemberRelation</tt> and <tt>ldp:isMemberOfRelation</tt> predicates.  This allowed for convenient inverse properties: </p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>@prefix ldp:   &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#&gt; .\n@prefix schema: &lt;http://schema.org/&gt; .\n&lt;&gt;\n    ldp:hasMemberRelation   schema:associatedMedia ;\n    ldp:isMemberOfRelation  schema:encodesCreativeWork ;\n    .</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p> F6 does not allow both failing with: <tt>Direct and Indirect containers must specify exactly one ldp:hasMemberRelation or ldp:isMemberOfRelation property, but multiple were present</tt> </p>\n\n<p>Not sure if there is a technical reason these can no longer exist together</p>",
